# program cc_spi_flash_id  (118 image bytes)
# source: ~/Documents/protocol-emulator/test/cocotb_tests/protocols.py:spi_master
# Reads a SPI NOR flash's JEDEC ID (9F) at 1 MHz, mode 0. Prints the 3 ID bytes
# (e.g. Digilent Pmod SF3 / Micron N25Q256: 20 BA 19). The first byte is don't-care.

test read_jedec_id
needs spi_flash SPI NOR flash on the Pmod top row (CS MOSI MISO SCK = uio0..3)
reset
drain 1
loop 00000000
cmds 
rx 0 4 200000 -
end
